---
title: "You're In - The ZeroFog"
permalink: /confirmation/
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head_extras %}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="description" content="You're signed up for the free ZeroFog training. Here's what happens next.">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_css %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/pages/confirmation.css">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<a href="/" class="brand">The Zero Fog</a>
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<main class="content">

  <h1 class="ty-headline">You're in - now check your email.</h1>

  <p class="ty-sub">The training link is on its way to your inbox. Should arrive in the next 2 minutes.</p>

  <div class="countdown-wrap">
    <p class="countdown-label">Training Opens In</p>
    <div class="countdown">
      <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="num" id="cd-hrs">00</span><span class="lbl">Hours</span></div>
      <span class="countdown-sep">:</span>
      <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="num" id="cd-min">00</span><span class="lbl">Minutes</span></div>
      <span class="countdown-sep">:</span>
      <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="num" id="cd-sec">00</span><span class="lbl">Seconds</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="countdown-note">Add it to your calendar - the link goes live when the timer hits zero.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="steps-section">

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Check your inbox right now.</p>
        <p class="step-text">Look for "ZeroFog" in your sender list. If it's not there within 2 minutes, check your Promotions or Spam folder and move it to your main inbox.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Mark it "not spam" and move to inbox.</p>
        <p class="step-text">This is critical. If you don't, the next email - the one with your training link - won't reach you. Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo - they all filter aggressively.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Show up to the training.</p>
        <p class="step-text">Live attendees get 3 free guides delivered right after. Skip the training and you skip those too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="bullets-section">
    <p class="bullets-heading">For attendees, you'll also get:</p>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text"><strong class="accent-name">Your Caffeine Blueprint</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text"><strong class="accent-name">9 Recovery Mistakes</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text"><strong class="accent-name">The Recovery Protocol</strong></p>
    </div>

    <p class="bonus-note">Delivered to your inbox right after you watch.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="credibility">
    <p class="credibility-text">I work from home. For 3 years I ran on coffee and willpower. Brain fog, bad decisions, crashed by 2 PM every day. I tried everything - morning routines, productivity systems, supplements. None of it lasted. Then I found what was actually broken - and fixed it in weeks. This training is the thing I wish someone had showed me 3 years ago.</p>
    <p class="credibility-author">- Kirill, ZeroFog</p>
  </div>

  <div class="final-cta">
    <p>Check your email - we'll see you inside.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer">This is an educational wellness program, not medical treatment. Results vary.</p>

</main>

{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
<script src="/assets/js/pages/confirmation.js" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
